/// issubclass_ returns true if and only if arg1 is a direct subclass of arg2 according to:
/// - Reflexivity: any type class = subclass of itself.
/// - Leaves to their mid-level class:
///     Int8Type,...UInt64Type ⊂ IntegerType
///     Float32Type, Float64Type ⊂ FloatingType
